\caption(Every selected-channel objective trace and all256final channel responses. Cross-channel dominance is measured without selecting or omitting any target;optimization does not guarantee class-like images or channel exclusivity.)
\alttext(Every selected-channel objective trace and all256final channel responses. Cross-channel dominance is measured without selecting or omitting any target;optimization does not guarantee class-like images or channel exclusivity.)


> Conclusion

Every channel,objective term and bounded input step remains inspectable. Seed,prior and initialization controls expose dependence;full cross-channel responses show that maximizing one unit does not make it exclusive. Activation gain does not establish a semantic prototype,causal explanation or recognition improvement.

> References

- [Olah,Mordvintsev and Schubert(2017),Feature Visualization](https://distill.pub/2017/feature-visualization/).
